B.bwM=new A.ap(B.byQ,["There is already a shift with that name. Two shifts called the same thing cannot be told apart on a muster.","There is already a week-off pattern with that name.","Another pattern is already the default. Turning this one on moves it - it does not need to be turned off there first.","A unit with that code already exists.","That kind of unit already has a base unit. There can only be one, because every conversion is measured against it.","Another party already has that code.","That date is already a holiday.","That supplier's invoice number has already been entered against him. Open the existing bill before raising another - the same invoice booked twice is paid twice.","That serial number has already been received. Either it is still on the books from last time, or two items have been given the same number.",u.v,u.v,u.v,u.v,u.v,u.v,"Another item already has that code.","Another store already has that code.","Another employee already has that code.","That GSTIN is already recorded for this company."],t.w)
